      },
      "visualSeconds": 10,
      "leadSeconds": 0.25,
      "tailSeconds": 1.6,
      "narration": "集團的早晨，從老闆的一通電話開始。老闆問：帳上有錢嗎？小衡看了一眼Power BI報表：有，約四點三億元。老闆說：那就好。小衡補一句：不過，有個口袋，十月十五日會先見底。電話那頭，安靜了。",
      "voice": "audio/s01-call.wav",
      "startFrame": 90,
      "durationFrames": 706,
      "endFrame": 796,
      "voiceStartFrame": 98,
      "voiceFrames": 650
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-pockets",
      "title": "六個口袋",
      "visual": {
        "subject": {
          "id": "pockets",
          "type": "pocket-rig"
        },
        "style": "flat",
        "motion": {
          "action": "pop-in",
          "effect": "mg-split"
        },
        "renderer": "canvas2d"
      },
      "visualSeconds": 6,
      "leadSeconds": 0.25,
      "tailSeconds": 0.45,
      "narration": "星橋集團有六個口袋：總部、華東、華南、華北、跨境運營、香港貿易。錢不是一鍋粥，是六個口袋，各有各的脾氣。",
      "voice": "audio/s02-pockets.wav",
      "startFrame": 796,
      "durationFrames": 385,
      "endFrame": 1181,
      "voiceStartFrame": 804,
      "voiceFrames": 363
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-safety",
      "title": "第一站・資金安全總覽",
      "visual": {
        "subject": {
          "id": "pocket-hk",
          "type": "pocket-rig"
        },
        "style": "flat",
        "motion": {
          "action": "sweat",
          "effect": "mg-chart"
        },
        "renderer": "canvas2d"
      },
      "visualSeconds": 12,
      "leadSeconds": 0.25,
      "tailSeconds": 0.5,
      "narration": "第一頁，一句話判斷：總量充裕，區域性存在資金缺口。最低也有約三點六億元，是備付底線的二十九點六倍，穩得很。可是按法人和幣種分開看，香港貿易的人民幣口袋，十月十五日開始見底，缺口最大約九百零九萬元。整座水庫是滿的，偏偏有一戶的水龍頭，在咳嗽。原因是合同回款，只夠付支出的百分之十三點六。",
      "voice": "audio/s03-safety.wav",
      "startFrame": 1181,
      "durationFrames": 959,
      "endFrame": 2140,
      "voiceStartFrame": 1189,
      "voiceFrames": 936
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-flows",
      "title": "第二站・收支與預算",
      "visual": {
        "subject": {
          "id": "yuanqi",
          "type": "yuanqi-rig"
        },
        "style": "flat",
        "motion": {
          "action": "flow",
          "effect": "mg-gauge"
        },
        "renderer": "canvas2d"
      },
      "visualSeconds": 10,
      "leadSeconds": 0.25,
      "tailSeconds": 0.5,
      "narration": "第二頁看收支。淨現金流約三點七億元，全靠經營活動撐著。預算執行率百分之一百一十點五，在財務圈，這不叫超標達成，叫超支。各法人裡，香港貿易最高，一百二十六點一，這個口袋，今天特別忙。",
      "voice": "audio/s04-flows.wav",
      "startFrame": 2140,
      "durationFrames": 694,
      "endFrame": 2834,
      "voiceStartFrame": 2148,
      "voiceFrames": 671
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-timeline",
      "title": "第三站・渠道結算與到期",
      "visual": {
        "subject": {
          "id": "yuanqi",
          "type": "yuanqi-rig"
        },
        "style": "flat",
        "motion": {
          "action": "walk-slow",
          "effect": "mg-calendar"
        },
        "renderer": "canvas2d"
      },
      "visualSeconds": 10,
      "leadSeconds": 0.25,
      "tailSeconds": 0.5,
      "narration": "第三頁看時間表。未結應收約一千三百三十七萬元，逾期七十一萬元，逾期率百分之五點三，像朋友說下週還，結果慢了一點點。自家的逾期應付是零，是個準時付款的好公民。未來三十日要付約四千八百一十三萬元。",
      "voice": "audio/s05-timeline.wav",
      "startFrame": 2834,
      "durationFrames": 737,
      "endFrame": 3571,
      "voiceStartFrame": 2842,
      "voiceFrames": 714
    },
    {
      "id": "s06-borrow",
      "title": "第四站・融資與金融工具",
      "visual": {
        "subject": {
          "id": "xiaoheng",
          "type": "finance-lead-rig"
        },
        "style": "flat",
        "motion": {
          "action": "bump-glass",
          "effect": "mg-bank"
        },
        "renderer": "canvas2d"
      },
      "visualSeconds": 10,
      "leadSeconds": 0.25,
      "tailSeconds": 0.5,
      "narration": "第四頁看借錢。貸款餘額約七千零一十七萬元，加權年利率百分之五點七三。另有可提款授信約七千七百零七萬元，但授信只是備用額度，像朋友說缺錢跟我說，心意收下，房租不能用心意付。理財可變現，是零。",
      "voice": "audio/s06-borrow.wav",
      "startFrame": 3571,
      "durationFrames": 742,
      "endFrame": 4313,
      "voiceStartFrame": 3579,
      "voiceFrames": 719
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-pool",
      "title": "第五站・集團資金調配",
      "visual": {
        "subject": {
          "id": "yuanqi",
          "type": "yuanqi-rig"
        },
        "style": "flat",
        "motion": {
          "action": "queue-walk",
          "effect": "mg-pool"
        },
        "renderer": "canvas2d"
      },
      "visualSeconds": 10,
      "leadSeconds": 0.25,
      "tailSeconds": 0.5,
      "narration": "第五頁，是小衡最喜歡的一頁：先別急著借，看看家裡誰有餘。人民幣資金池約一點五億元，補得上香港貿易九百零九萬元的缺口，匹配後缺口是零。不過這只是候選安排，要經過審批。再熱心的口袋，也得等簽核點頭。",
      "voice": "audio/s07-pool.wav",
      "startFrame": 4313,
      "durationFrames": 708,
      "endFrame": 5021,
      "voiceStartFrame": 4321,
      "voiceFrames": 685
    },
    {
      "id": "s08-fx",
      "title": "第六站・跨境與匯率風險",
      "visual": {
        "subject": {
          "id": "xiaoheng",
          "type": "finance-lead-rig"
        },
        "style": "flat",
        "motion": {
          "action": "stack",
          "effect": "mg-tower"
        },
        "renderer": "canvas2d"
      },
      "visualSeconds": 10,
      "leadSeconds": 0.25,
      "tailSeconds": 0.5,
      "narration": "最後一頁看匯率。對沖前的淨敞口約一點九六億元，美元最大。做了遠期，淨敞口反而從一億九千六百一十六萬元，增加到一億九千八百二十四萬元，因為買進的方向，和原本的多頭同一邊。就像想減肥，卻多點了一份炸雞。各幣種不利變動百分之五，影響約負九百九十一萬元。",
      "voice": "audio/s08-fx.wav",
      "startFrame": 5021,
      "durationFrames": 767,
      "endFrame": 5788,
      "voiceStartFrame": 5029,
      "voiceFrames": 744
    },
    {
      "id": "s09-evening",
      "title": "傍晚",
      "visual": {
        "subject": {
          "id": "xiaoheng",
          "type": "finance-lead-rig"
        },
        "style": "flat",
        "motion": {
          "action": "stitch",
          "effect": "mg-endcard"
        },
        "renderer": "canvas2d"
      },
      "visualSeconds": 10,
      "leadSeconds": 0.25,
      "tailSeconds": 3.2,
      "narration": "傍晚，老闆又打來：所以，我們到底有沒有錢？小衡笑了：有。好的資金分析，不是告訴你還剩多少，而是告訴你，接下來該做什麼安排。至少這一晚，小衡知道該去敲哪一扇門，而那個口袋，還來得及補回元氣。",
      "voice": "audio/s09-evening.wav",
      "startFrame": 5788,
      "durationFrames": 697,
      "endFrame": 6485,
      "voiceStartFrame": 5796,
      "voiceFrames": 593
    }
